  "question": {
    "text": "The amount (in grams) of sucrose <math> <mrow> <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mol</mtext><mtext>.wt</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>342</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow> </math> that should be dissolved in <math> <mrow> <mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g</mtext></mrow> </math> water in order to produce a solution with a <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mn>105.0</mn></mrow> <mtext>o</mtext> </msup> <mtext>C</mtext></mrow> </math> difference between the boiling point and freezing point is<br />\r(Given that <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ƒ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.52</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> for water)<br />\rReport your answer by rounding it up to the nearest whole number.",
    "image": null
  },
